<title>BRAZIL: Brazil bolsa capitalization at $216.92 bln in 1996.</title>
<headline>Brazil bolsa capitalization at $216.92 bln in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo bourse's market capitalization ended the year at $216.927 billion, the stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Of a total of 550 companies listed, state telecommunications firm Telebras showed the highest market value at $24.023 billion, followed by state power utility Eletrobras at $19.351 billion and state oil firm Petrobras at $14.822 billion.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
